So you should just convert it!  Here's my secret for dealing with priests
that are pissed off that you converted their altar:

On the way down, make sure you collect a pick-axe and a bow and lots and lots
of arrows.  (The Gnomish Mines are full of these three items). Then, when
you reach the town level, use the altar to check the cursed/uncursed status
of your stuff.  Then go out and use the pick-axe on the top wall to the temple,
removing it.  Now kill a gnome, bring it over to the altar and sacrifice. 
Repeat as many times as it takes to convert it.  Then run out of the temple.
The priest won't follow!! Now ready your bow and arrow, and fire away! Since
you've wiped out the top wall, you can move back and forth to keep the priest
in the line of fire!  When he's dead, you can use the altar at your leisure. :)

